        "(?:bl[ei]+d\\w*|rakt\\w*|రక్త\\S*|బ్లీడ\\S*|h(?:a)?emorrhag\\w*)(?:(?!\\bnot\\b|\\bno\\b|\\bnever\\b|\\bwithout\\b|\\bnor\\b|n't|\\bdont\\b|లేదు|లేవు|లేకుండా|\\bledu\\b|\\blevu\\b).){0,80}(?:గర్భ\\S*|pregnan\\w*|garbh\\w*|expecting|trimester|త్రైమాసిక\\S*|\\d+\\s*(?:st|nd|rd|th)?\\s*months?|[౦-౯0-9]+\\s*(?:వ\\s*)?నెల\\S*|eighth|ninth|seventh)",
        "(?:(?:after|post)\\s*[- ]?(?:delivery|birth|childbirth|labou?r|partum)|ప్రసవం\\S*|డెలివరీ\\S*|కాన్పు\\S*|delivery|prasav\\w*)(?:(?!\\bnot\\b|\\bno\\b|\\bnever\\b|\\bwithout\\b|\\bnor\\b|n't|\\bdont\\b|లేదు|లేవు|లేకుండా|\\bledu\\b|\\blevu\\b).){0,80}(?:bl[ei]+d\\w*|rakt\\w*|రక్త\\S*|బ్లీడ\\S*|h(?:a)?emorrhag\\w*)",
        "(?:bl[ei]+d\\w*|rakt\\w*|రక్త\\S*|బ్లీడ\\S*|h(?:a)?emorrhag\\w*)(?:(?!\\bnot\\b|\\bno\\b|\\bnever\\b|\\bwithout\\b|\\bnor\\b|n't|\\bdont\\b|లేదు|లేవు|లేకుండా|\\bledu\\b|\\blevu\\b).){0,80}(?:(?:after|post)\\s*[- ]?(?:delivery|birth|childbirth|labou?r|partum)|ప్రసవం\\S*|డెలివరీ\\S*|కాన్పు\\S*|delivery|prasav\\w*)",
